<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Aguardando Pedido</title>
  <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; background: #f0f2f5; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .main-content { max-width: 100% !important; width: calc(100% - 250px); box-sizing: border-box; }
    @media (max-width: 768px) { .main-content { width: 100%; } }
    .container { max-width: 100%; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); box-sizing: border-box; }
    h1 { margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 1.5rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 28px 0 10px; }
    .page-sub { color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.5; }

    .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    @media (max-width: 480px) { .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
    .stat-card { border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; background: #fafafa; }
    .stat-label { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #6b7280; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .stat-value { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; line-height: 1; }
    .stat-card--yellow { border-color: #fde68a; background: #fffbeb; }
    .stat-card--green  { border-color: #bbf7d0; background: #f0fdf4; }
    .stat-card--blue   { border-color: #bfdbfe; background: #eff6ff; }
    .stat-card--gray   { border-color: #e5e7eb; background: #f9fafb; }

    .table-wrap { width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 1150px; }
    th { background: #f9fafb; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: #374151; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; white-space: nowrap; }
    td { padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-size: 0.85rem; vertical-align: top; }
    tr:hover td { background: #fafafa; }
    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .cell-main { font-weight: 700; color: #111827; }
    .cell-sub { font-size: 0.76rem; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 3px; }
    .mono { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; }

    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
    .badge--green  { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
    .badge--blue   { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
    .badge--yellow { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
    .badge--red    { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
    .badge--gray   { background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; }
    .badge--orange { background: #ffedd5; color: #9a3412; }

    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; padding: 6px 13px; border-radius: 6px; border: none; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none; }
    .btn:hover { filter: brightness(0.92); }
    .btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
    .btn--primary { background: #4f46e5; color: #fff; }
    .btn--green   { background: #16a34a; color: #fff; }
    .btn--ghost   { background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; }

    .note { background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 0.83rem; color: #1e3a8a; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .note b { color: #1e40af; }
    .note code { background: #dbeafe; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.78rem; }

    .empty-state { text-align: center; padding: 42px 24px; color: #9ca3af; }
    .empty-state p { font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0; }

    #toast { position: fixed; bottom: 24px; right: 24px; background: #111827; color: #fff; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); transition: all 0.25s ease; pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999; max-width: 340px; }
    #toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    #toast.ok  { background: #166534; }
    #toast.err { background: #991b1b; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="painel-page">
  <%- include('partials/painel_sidebar', { page: 'aguardando' }) %>
  <div class="main-content">
  <div class="container">

    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; margin-bottom:6px;">
      <div>
        <h1>Aguardando Pedido</h1>
        <p class="page-sub">
          Pedidos de <b>seguidores</b> represados porque o mesmo perfil já tinha outro pedido de seguidores
          nas últimas <%= cfg.windowHours %>h que ainda não concluiu no fornecedor.
          O envio sai sozinho assim que o pedido de referência ficar <b>Completed</b>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:8px;">
        <button class="btn btn--primary" id="btnCheck">Verificar agora</button>
        <a href="/painel/aguardando" class="btn btn--ghost">Atualizar</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <% if (!cfg.enabled) { %>
      <div class="note" style="background:#fef2f2; border-color:#fecaca; color:#991b1b;">
        <b>Fila desligada</b> — <code>FOLLOWERS_QUEUE_ENABLED=false</code>. Todo pedido está sendo despachado na hora.
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="note">
      Só entram aqui pedidos de <b>seguidores</b> (mistos, brasileiros e orgânicos) — curtidas e visualizações passam direto.
      O pedido represado continua normal para o cliente: e-mail, nota fiscal, cupom e link de refil saem na hora; só o envio ao fornecedor espera.
      Se o pedido de referência travar, este é liberado à força após <b><%= cfg.maxWaitHours %>h</b>.
    </div>

    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card stat-card--yellow">
        <div class="stat-label">Aguardando agora</div>
        <div class="stat-value"><%= held.length %></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card stat-card--blue">
        <div class="stat-label">Perfis na fila</div>
        <div class="stat-value"><%= [...new Set(held.map(h => h.username))].length %></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card stat-card--green">
        <div class="stat-label">Despachados (7d)</div>
        <div class="stat-value"><%= (typeof released !== 'undefined' ? released.length : 0) %></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card stat-card--gray">
        <div class="stat-label">Janela / espera máx.</div>
        <div class="stat-value" style="font-size:1.15rem;"><%= cfg.windowHours %>h / <%= cfg.maxWaitHours %>h</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Na fila (<%= held.length %>)</h2>
    <% if (!held.length) { %>
      <div class="empty-state"><p>Nenhum pedido represado. Tudo sendo despachado normalmente.</p></div>
    <% } else { %>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Perfil</th>
            <th>Pedido de referência (segura a fila)</th>
            <th>Status no fornecedor</th>
            <th>Pedido aguardando</th>
            <th>Qtd</th>
            <th>Fornecedor</th>
            <th>OrderID (após despacho)</th>
            <th>Esperando há</th>
            <th>Ação</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        <% held.forEach(function(h) { %>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="cell-main">@<%= h.username || '—' %></span></td>
            <td>
              <% if (h.ref) {
                   var refProvLabel = (h.ref.provider === 'fama24h' ? 'Fama24h' : h.ref.provider === 'fornecedor_social' ? 'Fornecedor Social' : h.ref.provider === 'topfama' ? 'TopFama' : 'Fornecedor');
              %>
                <% if (h.ref.providerOrderIds && h.ref.providerOrderIds.length) { %>
                  <div class="cell-main mono"><%= refProvLabel %> #<%= h.ref.providerOrderIds.join(', #') %></div>
                <% } else { %>
                  <div class="cell-main" style="color:#b45309;">não despachado</div>
                <% } %>
                <div class="cell-sub">
                  <%= h.ref.tipo || '?' %> · <%= h.ref.quantidade ? h.ref.quantidade.toLocaleString('pt-BR') : '?' %>
                  · <span title="ID da transação na plataforma" style="color:#94a3b8;">tx <%= h.ref.identifier || '—' %></span>
                </div>
              <% } else { %>
                <span class="cell-sub">pedido não encontrado</span>
              <% } %>
            </td>
            <td>
              <% var sts = (h.ref && h.ref.statuses) ? h.ref.statuses : []; %>
              <% if (sts.length) { sts.forEach(function(s) { %>
                <span class="badge <%= s === 'completed' ? 'badge--green' : (s === 'processing' ? 'badge--blue' : (s === 'pending' ? 'badge--yellow' : (s === 'cancelled' ? 'badge--red' : 'badge--gray'))) %>"><%= s %></span>
              <% }); } else { %>
                <span class="badge badge--gray"><%= (h.ref && h.ref.reason === 'blocker_not_dispatched') ? 'não despachado' : '—' %></span>
              <% } %>
              <% if (h.lastCheckAt) { %>
                <div class="cell-sub">checado <%= new Date(h.lastCheckAt).toLocaleString('pt-BR') %></div>
              <% } %>
            </td>
            <td>
              <div class="cell-main mono"><%= h.identifier || '—' %></div>
              <div class="cell-sub"><%= h.tipo || '?' %></div>
            </td>
            <td><%= h.quantidade ? h.quantidade.toLocaleString('pt-BR') : '—' %></td>
            <td><span class="badge badge--gray"><%= h.providerLabel %></span></td>
            <td>
              <% if (h.providerOrderIds && h.providerOrderIds.length) { %>
                <span class="mono">#<%= h.providerOrderIds.join(', #') %></span>
              <% } else { %>
                <span class="cell-sub">— aguardando</span>
              <% } %>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="waiting-since" data-since="<%= h.heldAt || '' %>">—</span>
              <% if (h.releaseAfterAt) { %>
                <div class="cell-sub">solta em <%= new Date(h.releaseAfterAt).toLocaleString('pt-BR') %></div>
              <% } %>
            </td>
            <td>
              <button class="btn btn--green btn-release" data-id="<%= h.identifier || h.mongoId %>">Liberar agora</button>
            </td>
          </tr>
        <% }); %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <% } %>

    <% var releasedRows = (typeof released !== 'undefined' && Array.isArray(released)) ? released : []; %>
    <h2>Despachados — histórico <span style="font-size:0.75rem; color:#6b7280; font-weight:400;">(últimos 7 dias · <%= releasedRows.length %>)</span></h2>
    <% if (!releasedRows.length) { %>
      <div class="empty-state"><p>Nenhum pedido despachado pela fila nos últimos 7 dias.</p></div>
    <% } else { %>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Perfil</th>
            <th>Pedido</th>
            <th>Qtd</th>
            <th>Fornecedor</th>
            <th>OrderID</th>
            <th>Despachado em</th>
            <th>Situação</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        <% releasedRows.forEach(function(h) { %>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="cell-main">@<%= h.username || '—' %></span></td>
            <td>
              <div class="cell-main mono"><%= h.identifier || '—' %></div>
              <div class="cell-sub"><%= h.tipo || '?' %></div>
            </td>
            <td><%= h.quantidade ? h.quantidade.toLocaleString('pt-BR') : '—' %></td>
            <td><span class="badge badge--gray"><%= h.providerLabel %></span></td>
            <td>
              <% if (h.providerOrderIds && h.providerOrderIds.length) { %>
                <span class="mono">#<%= h.providerOrderIds.join(', #') %></span>
              <% } else { %>
                <span class="cell-sub">—</span>
              <% } %>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="cell-sub"><%= h.releasedAt ? new Date(h.releasedAt).toLocaleString('pt-BR') : '—' %></span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <% if (h.dispatched) { %>
                <span class="badge badge--green">✓ Despachado</span>
              <% } else { %>
                <span class="badge badge--yellow">liberado</span>
              <% } %>
              <% if (h.releaseReason) {
                   var reasonLabel = h.releaseReason === 'blocker_finished' ? 'referência concluiu'
                     : (h.releaseReason === 'already_dispatched' ? 'já despachado antes'
                     : (h.releaseReason === 'max_wait_expired' ? 'liberado por tempo (espera máx.)'
                     : (h.releaseReason === 'manual_release' ? 'liberado manual' : h.releaseReason)));
              %>
                <div class="cell-sub"><%= reasonLabel %></div>
              <% } %>
            </td>
          </tr>
        <% }); %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <% } %>

  </div>
  </div>

  <div id="toast"></div>

  <script>
    function toast(msg, kind) {
      var t = document.getElementById('toast');
      t.textContent = msg;
      t.className = 'show ' + (kind || '');
      setTimeout(function () { t.className = ''; }, 4000);
    }

    // "Esperando há X" calculado no cliente para não depender do fuso do servidor
    (function renderWaiting() {
      document.querySelectorAll('.waiting-since').forEach(function (el) {
        var since = el.getAttribute('data-since');
        if (!since) { el.textContent = '—'; return; }
        var ms = Date.now() - new Date(since).getTime();
        if (!isFinite(ms) || ms < 0) { el.textContent = '—'; return; }
        var min = Math.floor(ms / 60000);
        if (min < 60) el.textContent = min + ' min';
        else if (min < 1440) el.textContent = Math.floor(min / 60) + 'h ' + (min % 60) + 'min';
        else el.textContent = Math.floor(min / 1440) + 'd ' + Math.floor((min % 1440) / 60) + 'h';
      });
    })();

    document.getElementById('btnCheck').addEventListener('click', function () {
      var btn = this;
      btn.disabled = true;
      btn.textContent = 'Verificando...';
      fetch('/api/painel/followers-queue/check', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' } })
        .then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
        .then(function (j) {
          if (!j.ok) { toast('Falhou: ' + (j.error || j.skipped || 'erro'), 'err'); btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = 'Verificar agora'; return; }
          toast('Checados ' + j.checked + ' · liberados ' + j.released + ' · ainda na fila ' + j.stillWaiting, 'ok');
          setTimeout(function () { location.reload(); }, 1200);
        })
        .catch(function (e) { toast('Erro: ' + e.message, 'err'); btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = 'Verificar agora'; });
    });

    document.querySelectorAll('.btn-release').forEach(function (btn) {
      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        var id = btn.getAttribute('data-id');
        if (!confirm('Liberar ' + id + ' agora, sem esperar o pedido de referência concluir?')) return;
        btn.disabled = true;
        btn.textContent = 'Liberando...';
        fetch('/api/painel/followers-queue/release', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ identifier: id })
        })
          .then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
          .then(function (j) {
            if (!j.ok) { toast('Falhou: ' + (j.error || 'erro'), 'err'); btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = 'Liberar agora'; return; }
            toast('Liberado e despachado: ' + id, 'ok');
            setTimeout(function () { location.reload(); }, 1200);
          })
          .catch(function (e) { toast('Erro: ' + e.message, 'err'); btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = 'Liberar agora'; });
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
